      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Headache is a disabling condition, and medical science has not, until recently, begun to address it in a fashion consistent with its widespread impact. Despite the limitations in our current understanding, as well as the historical prejudice directed toward patients with this condition, current understanding and treatment approaches can provide hope and relief for most patients who have these disorders."},
